    "created_at": "2022-07-28T15:56:47Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-07-28T15:56:47Z",
    "body": "There's at least two different things here:\r\n\r\n1. File API currently doesn't use \"parse a MIME type\", but it should: https://github.com/w3c/FileAPI/issues/43. (There's already tests for this in WPT.)\r\n2. Fetch should probably special case the empty string value and not set a `Content-Type` header in that case. I think \"we\" forgot to account for that case.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
